#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Set up the company's payroll:
#. insurances, salary rules, holidays, accounting'
#: hrms/payroll/onboarding_step/configure_the_company_payroll/configure_the_company_payroll.json
msgid ""
"<h3>Company Payroll Setup</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Short steps, prefilled with what the company already has: canton, UID and the person in charge of the payroll; the rates of the AVS fund, LAA, IJM, LAAC and family allowance policies; the salary rules of the contracts (13th, 14th and 15th salaries and their provision, the value of a vacation day paid at the exit, the flat-rate expenses); the canton's public holidays; how salaries and social charges are booked, on which accounts, and whether the salaries leave the bank as one debit; the salary certificate header. It creates the company's default social insurance configuration. Run it again any time to change a choice."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Data Import'
#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/data_import/data_import.json
msgid ""
"<h3>Data Import</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Data import is the tool to migrate your existing data like Employee, Customer, Supplier, and a lot more to our ERPNext system.\n"
"Go through the video for a detailed explanation of this tool."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Create Employee'
#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/create_employee/create_employee.json
